                </common:classification>
            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Production of a exhaust air system for kitchens in appartment buildings. The reference value of the inventory is 1 m2 heated gross floor area. The inventory is an estimate based on a study of an exhaust air system for kitchen and bathrooms of one large appartment building with a heated gross floor area of 30800 m2.The inventory includes materials needed for fans and ducts. The data represents ductwork mainly made of galvanized steel. It includes duct fans and radial fans without heat recovery and a nominal air flow rate of 500-5700 m3/h per unit.;
UUID: 84800d40-3065-39de-87ac-e0b3ef2f3eb9</common:generalComment>
